[gd_scene load_steps=9 format=3]

; The violet glow an actor carries (#9a5cff, the spectacles' glass): a light on the scenery, an additive
; halo over the sprite and a few rising sparkles. Off until CutsceneGlow.Set lights it. The light skips
; render layer 2 (the billboard sprites), so it never washes out the sprite it sits on.

